# The Google OAuth client id created in Google Cloud Console (Credentials -> OAuth client ID -> Web
# application). Not a secret -- it is sent to the browser -- but environment-specific, so it lives
# here rather than being hardcoded. Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the real value.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=

# Leave unset locally -- the Vite dev proxy (vite.config.ts) already makes the Api same-origin.
# Set in production (task 09b CI) to the deployed Container App's own origin, e.g.
# https://quotedesk-api.<region>.azurecontainerapps.io -- Static Web Apps and the Api are two
# separate hosts there, and SSE cannot go through an SWA proxy route (it buffers the response).
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
